{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight, Capture and Develop a Team of Monstra as you Explore Ancient Ruins and gather Hundreds of Collectables in... Monstra Cap!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore Cities, Mountains, Caves, Ruins and more!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Hundreds of Monstra and Artifacts!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Items and Gear to Aid your Monstra in Combat!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the Secrets behind the recent rise in Monstra Hostility!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop your Monstra over time by assigning Level Up Points!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master the art of Summoning and Fight Monstra with Monstra! When a Monstra takes enough damage it enters its Soul Form, then you can Capture it in a Monstra Capsule, expanding your Team of Monstra!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Monstra Cap is a Single Player, Monster Capture, Action-RPG-Collectathon with a strong Retro style design.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971080?t=1756562451","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3971080?t=1756562451","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971080/cd19caf298c22e2a2339ca7bbe6c110f6a6667c7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756562451","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3971080/cd19caf298c22e2a2339ca7bbe6c110f6a6667c7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756562451","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":